  "body": "Replace hand-rolled lazy initialization with C++11 function-local static to ensure thread-safe key initialization on dual-core targets. Add mutex protection to credential store operations to prevent race conditions. Include password length validation to detect corrupted credentials during deserialization.\r\n\r\nWifi passwords could become corrupted when recent wifi network changed, a new wifi network was added, or if you edited your wifi info in the web server",
